# Planet Killer: "Flying, indestructible", "This creature attacks each combat if able", and "Whenever this creature deals
# combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on it for each land that player controls" (CR 510.2, 603.2c, 122.1). Bot1
# casts it on turn 1 off Black Lotus and five Moxen, then plays a Forest on turn 3, so both players have one land when it
# connects: Bot2's Shatter destroyed nothing (indestructible), its Memnite may not block (flying), and the trigger puts
# one counter - Bot2's land, not Bot1's too. On turn 5 Bot2 has two lands and the second hit adds two counters.

